export anchor ShippingLabelsStyle:
    number: 134
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Shipping labels
    idea: Every panel is a white parcel label stuck on kraft cardboard, with thick black rules, barcodes, tracking codes and handling pictograms for status.
    base: light
    palette:
        kraft: #e3d1b0, the page as cardboard
        tape: #c9ae7f, translucent tape strips on label tops, decoration only
        label: #ffffff, every panel, field and nav code
        ink: #111111, text, rules, barcodes, fill bars and the primary button
        grey: #4d4d4d, units and type notes
        green: #1d6a33, the On track mark with two up arrows
        amber: #8f5300, the At risk mark with a wine glass
        red: #b8141b, the Behind mark with a crossed box, the overdue box and number
        marker: #ffe14a, the focus halo only
    type:
        Two stacks. Condensed sans for nearly everything uses Arial Narrow,
        Helvetica Neue Condensed, Roboto Condensed, Arial at weight 800 for
        titles and numbers. Mono for codes and dates uses SF Mono, Menlo,
        Consolas, monospace. Summary numbers 64px, greeting 44px, label
        titles 24px, body 15px, captions 11px bold caps tracked 0.14em,
        tracking codes 12px mono.
    layout:
        The header is one wide label split by 3px rules into a From cell
        with a box logo and the brand, a search cell, and a Deliver to cell
        with New project, a square bell and the user. Nav is a row of boxed
        service codes numbered 01 to 06, the current one inverted black.
        Below sit a Dispatch note label with the greeting, the date in mono
        and a red boxed overdue warning, beside a Manifest label holding the
        four numbers in ruled cells. Projects are six labels in three
        columns, each with a category and status mark on top, the name, a
        barcode and tracking code, a dashed tear grid of Done, Weight and
        Deliver by, and a black fill bar. A Tracking history label lists
        activity with mono times on the left. A Daily scans label holds the
        black bar chart with values, a divider between weeks and two ruled
        total cells. Below 1000px labels go two across and the top stacks.
        Below 680px everything is one column and header cells stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 12px inside label cells, 20 to 24px between labels.
    density: Medium dense. Each label packs code, name, three fields and a bar.
    corners: 4px on labels, 3px on nav codes, square buttons and fields.
    borders: 3px solid ink around labels and between header cells, 2px dashed ink tear lines inside.
    shadows: One hard brown shadow 2px right and 3px down, like a sticker lifting off board.
    icons:
        Filled handling pictograms at 20px in a 2px bordered mark with the
        caps word. Two up arrows on a base for On track, a wine glass for At
        risk, a crossed box for Behind, a filled warning triangle for
        overdue. The bell is a 2px outline.
    focus: A 3px ink outline offset 2px inside a 7px marker yellow halo.
    tone: Courier terms in caps, such as Dispatch note, Manifest, Deliver by and Tracking history.
